msgid "Notes for you. Anything that you did during a day that might have helped you if you had migraine. For example, I had a headache, and I took a nap, or I went for a walk. Or on the other hand, things that might have worsened your headache or caused it."
msgstr "Poznámky pre vás. Čokoľvek, čo ste počas dňa urobili a čo by vám mohlo pomôcť, ak ste mali migrénu. Napríklad: bolela ma hlava a zdriemol som si, alebo som išiel na prechádzku. Alebo naopak veci, ktoré mohli vašu bolesť hlavy zhoršiť alebo ju vyvolať."

